"info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Data/Nat/ExtendedGcd.html#Nat.extendedGcd_zero_left","kind":"theorem","line":73,"name":"Nat.extendedGcd_zero_left","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/Nat/ExtendedGcd.lean#L73-L75"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/ExtendedGcd.html#Nat.extendedGcd.go\"><span class=\"name\">Nat</span>.<span class=\"name\">extendedGcd</span>.<span class=\"name\">go</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">r</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s </span><span class=\"fn\">t</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Basic.html#Int\">Int</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">r'</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s' </span><span class=\"fn\">t'</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Basic.html#Int\">Int</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/ExtendedGcd.html#Nat.ExtendedGcdResult\">ExtendedGcdResult</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Implementation detail of `Nat.extendedGcd`: the two rows represent the remainders as\nlinear combinations of the original inputs.","docLink":"./Init/Data/Nat/ExtendedGcd.html#Nat.extendedGcd.go","kind":"def","line":60,"name":"Nat.extendedGcd.go","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/Nat/ExtendedGcd.lean#L60-L65"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/ExtendedGcd.html#Nat.extendedGcd\"><span class=\"name\">Nat</span>.<span class=\"name\">extendedGcd</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/ExtendedGcd.html#Nat.ExtendedGcdResult\">ExtendedGcdResult</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Computes the greatest common divisor of `a` and `b` together with signed Bézout coefficients in\none pass of the extended Euclidean algorithm. The result `r` satisfies `r.gcd = Nat.gcd a b` and\n`(r.gcd : Int) = a * r.coeffA + b * r.coeffB`.\n\nFor a zero first input, the result is `⟨b, 0, 1⟩`, including `⟨0, 0, 1⟩` when both inputs are zero.\nFor a nonzero first input and a zero second input, the result is `⟨a, 1, 0⟩`.\nThe coefficients are not unique; no minimality or symmetry of the returned coefficients is\nspecified.\n\nExamples:\n* `Nat.extendedGcd 240 46 = ⟨2, -9, 47⟩`\n* `Nat.extendedGcd 0 19 = ⟨19, 0, 1⟩`\n* `Nat.extendedGcd 19 0 = ⟨19, 1, 0⟩`","docLink":"./Init/Data/Nat/ExtendedGcd.html#Nat.extendedGcd","kind":"def","line":39,"name":"Nat.extendedGcd","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/Nat/ExtendedGcd.lean#L39-L67"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/ExtendedGcd.html#Nat.instInhabitedExtendedGcdResult\"><span class=\"name\">Nat</span>.<span class=\"name\">instInhabitedExtendedGcdResult</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Inhabited\">Inhabited</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/ExtendedGcd.html#Nat.ExtendedGcdResult\">ExtendedGcdResult</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Data/Nat/ExtendedGcd.html#Nat.instInhabitedExtendedGcdResult","kind":"instance","line":37,"name":"Nat.instInhabitedExtendedGcdResult","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/Nat/ExtendedGcd.lean#L37-L37"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/ExtendedGcd.html#Nat.instDecidableEqExtendedGcdResult\"><span class=\"name\">Nat</span>.<span class=\"name\">instDecidableEqExtendedGcdResult</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#DecidableEq\">DecidableEq</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/ExtendedGcd.html#Nat.ExtendedGcdResult\">ExtendedGcdResult</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Data/Nat/ExtendedGcd.html#Nat.instDecidableEqExtendedGcdResult","kind":"instance","line":37,"name":"Nat.instDecidableEqExtendedGcdResult","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/Nat/ExtendedGcd.lean#L37-L37"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/ExtendedGcd.html#Nat.instDecidableEqExtendedGcdResult.decEq\"><span class=\"name\">Nat</span>.<span class=\"name\">instDecidableEqExtendedGcdResult</span>.<span class=\"name\">decEq</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x✝ </span><span class=\"fn\">x✝¹</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/ExtendedGcd.html#Nat.ExtendedGcdResult\">ExtendedGcdResult</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Decidable\">Decidable</a> (<span class=\"fn\">x✝</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">x✝¹</span>)</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Data/Nat/ExtendedGcd.html#Nat.instDecidableEqExtendedGcdResult.decEq","kind":"def","line":37,"name":"Nat.instD